      "act": "CHANGE — check and revise",
      "role_note": "terminal (Onda) — the REQUIRED revision",
      "narration_text": "That overconfidence is fixable. Ask Claude to update the script: apply Platt scaling to the random forest, recompute the calibration curve and Brier score, and show the before and after.",
      "shot": {
