      "act": "NEXT STEPS",
      "role_note": "what to do next",
      "narration_text": "Your move: pull the predicted probabilities from any model you're shipping and run sklearn's calibration curve on a held-out set. Check the Brier score. If the curve bends away from the diagonal at high confidence, add a calibration wrapper before any human trusts those numbers.",
      "visual_intent": "next-steps card: 1) run calibration curve on held-out set, 2) check Brier score, 3) wrap with CalibratedClassifierCV if needed",
